<AddOnInstructionDefinitions Use="Context">
<AddOnInstructionDefinition Use="Target" Name="I_AB56IF8H" Revision="3.1" RevisionExtension="02 Release" Vendor="Rockwell Automation" ExecutePrescan="true" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2013-12-02T15:35:44.355Z" CreatedBy="Not Available" EditedDate="2014-09-30T19:54:28.128Z"
 EditedBy="PROCESS\Library" SoftwareRevision="v18.02">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Allen-Bradley 1756-IF8H
HART AI Module]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[See V3.1-xx Release Notes for details. Modified MSG error / no HART data available handling.]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[Copyright © Rockwell Automation, Inc.  All Rights Reserved.

This instruction takes the input structure for the 1756-IF8H and
copies the data into individual structures for each of the eight
input channels. These structures are then used by the
I_56IFXH_CHAN instruction to provide error checking and
diagnostic information for each individual HART device.
]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
