<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Process 8-channel HART Analog Input module]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Copyright © Rockwell Automation, Inc.  All Rights Reserved.
============================================================
I/O / INSTRUMENTATION --Allen-Bradlehy 1756-IF8H
8-Channel HART Analog Input Module
============================================================
Revision 3.1-02 Release  2014-09-30:  See V3.1-xx Release Notes for details.
V3.0-00  2013-10-30:  Updated to PlantPAX Library of
Preferred Integration Objects.Updated to PlantPAx V3.0-xx.
Reduced number of MSG control blocks. Adjusted parameter naming.
V3.0-01  2014-01-22:  Backported to V18 of RSLogix 5000.
V3.0-02  2104-03-26:  Modified to avoid Minor Faults when
input contains floating-point exception values.
V3.1-00  2014-06-30:  No changes from V3.0-02.
V3.1-01  2014-09-03:  Added error text on DevInfo MSG error.
V3.1-02  2014-09-30:  Modified MSG error / no HART data available handling.
============================================================
This Instruction manages a ControlLogix 8-channel
Analog Input Module with HART.
============================================================
Request HART Device Information for Channel 00]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Inp_CfgUpdate00)OTU(Inp_CfgUpdate00)OTL(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.0)XIO(Wrk_CfgUpdateMSGReq)MOV(1,Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance)OTL(Wrk_CfgUpdateMSGReq);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Request HART Device Information for Channel 01]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Inp_CfgUpdate01)OTU(Inp_CfgUpdate01)OTL(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
