<![CDATA[XIC(Wrk_CfgUpdateMSGReq)XIO(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.EN)MSG(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When information is received back from the module, store it in the proper
member of the DevInfo array and allow the next message,

#####  V3.1-02  2014-09-30:  Modified MSG error / no HART data available handling.  #####]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Wrk_CfgUpdateMSGReq)XIC(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.DN)EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf.Status,0)[EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,1) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[0],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.0) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,2) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[1],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.1) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,3) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[2],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.2) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,4) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[3],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.3) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,5) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[4],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.4) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,6) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[5],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.5) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,7) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[6],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.6) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,8) COP(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf,Ref_DevInfo[7],1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.7) ]OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateMSGReq);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If the MSG errors or if the returned data indicates no HART response, post error text.

#####  V3.1-02  2014-09-30:  Modified MSG error / no HART data available handling.  #####]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Wrk_CfgUpdateMSGReq)[XIC(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.ER) ,XIC(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.DN) NEQ(Ref_ChanDevInfoBuf.Status,0) ][EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,1) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[0].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[0].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.0) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,2) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[1].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[1].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.1) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,3) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[2].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[2].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.2) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,4) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[3].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[3].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.3) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,5) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[4].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[4].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.4) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,6) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[5].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[5].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.5) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,7) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[6].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[6].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.6) ,EQU(Ref_ChanDevInfoMSG.Instance,8) COP(Wrk_MsgErrTxt,Ref_DevInfo[7].Message,1) FLL(0,Ref_DevInfo[7].Tag,1) OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateReq.7) ]OTU(Wrk_CfgUpdateMSGReq);]]>
</Text>
